{"4545290": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Madame Manager: Velvet Simulation", "steam_appid": 4545290, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "dlc": [4811720], "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >💋 MADAME MANAGER: VELVET SIMULATION:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Puts you in charge of running a brothel. The fate of the city’s most intimate business will be shaped by your moral choices and management style. Think you’ve got what it takes?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🎮 CORE MECHANICS:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The day begins and a wide variety of customers flood into your establishment. Your job is to carefully match them with the right employees to maximize satisfaction. Not just your staff’s quality, but your venue’s overall vibe matters too.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🧼 EMPLOYEE CLEANUP:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After every encounter, your employees end up a total mess. As a responsible manager, it’s on you to clean them up and get them ready for the next client.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4545290/extras/b4a65ae36ebec2f6226d5e2447dacc72.poster.avif?t=1781564276\" width=568 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4545290/extras/b4a65ae36ebec2f6226d5e2447dacc72.webm?t=1781564276\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4545290/extras/b4a65ae36ebec2f6226d5e2447dacc72.mp4?t=1781564276\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >💉 ILLNESS &amp; TREATMENT:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some customers may carry diseases. After all, you can’t exactly ask a homeless guy walking into a brothel for a health certificate. Your employees can get sick, and it’s your responsibility to treat them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4545290/extras/22a233e4a360237baffae320d4e362e4.poster.avif?t=1781564276\" width=568 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4545290/extras/22a233e4a360237baffae320d4e362e4.webm?t=1781564276\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4545290/extras/22a233e4a360237baffae320d4e362e4.mp4?t=1781564276\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🛎️ NEGOTIATING WITH CLIENTS:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customers come in all types. Some crave the warmth of a woman, others want a rough, masculine presence. Some are drawn to their own gender. Remember: the more niche and personal the desire, the bigger the payout.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4545290/extras/0b28d4a729ec70b7267a829ce8bb746a.poster.avif?t=1781564276\" width=568 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4545290/extras/0b28d4a729ec70b7267a829ce8bb746a.webm?t=1781564276\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4545290/extras/0b28d4a729ec70b7267a829ce8bb746a.mp4?t=1781564276\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🏗️ <strong>VENUE UPGRADES:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You’ll take a rundown, grimy place and turn it into a dream-like entertainment hotspot. Unlock new rooms, upgrade beds, add a dance floor, a bar, and more—build the city’s ultimate attraction.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4545290/extras/c8d4c1c6c985581e5177e4eed1a98ebd.poster.avif?t=1781564276\" width=568 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4545290/extras/c8d4c1c6c985581e5177e4eed1a98ebd.webm?t=1781564276\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4545290/extras/c8d4c1c6c985581e5177e4eed1a98ebd.mp4?t=1781564276\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >💵 COLLECTING MONEY &amp; ROOM CLEANUP:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some customers go all out emotionally… and physically. That usually leaves rooms in chaos. You’ll clean them up, because let’s be real—no one saves up for weeks just to walk into a filthy room. And yeah, don’t forget to grab your cash from the nightstand after the job’s done :)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4545290/extras/8d2d83090af0e49b8c4d2e826118c9fb.poster.avif?t=1781564276\" width=568 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4545290/extras/8d2d83090af0e49b8c4d2e826118c9fb.webm?t=1781564276\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4545290/extras/8d2d83090af0e49b8c4d2e826118c9fb.mp4?t=1781564276\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🌈 HIRING EMPLOYEES:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >People are unpredictable—especially when it comes to thei